OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CMystery of 2,000-year-old bog body     
OL,5,Csolved in 'first of its kind'          
OL,6,Cinvestigation                          
OL,7,GFor more than 2,000 years, the remains 
OL,8,Gof an Iron Age woman lay undiscovered  
OL,9,Gin bogland - her story unlikely to     
OL,10,Gever be told.                          
OL,12,FBut when archaeologists unearthed      
OL,13,Fhuman bones in 2023, it led to an      
OL,14,Funprecedented effort in Northern       
OL,15,FIreland to find out who they belonged  
OL,16,Fto - and what had happened to that     
OL,17,Fperson.                                
OL,19,FNow a coroner's investigation has been 
OL,20,Fheld at the Ulster Museum in Belfast   
OL,21,Fto establish the truth behind the      
OL,22,FBallymacombs More Woman.          G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
