OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CBlue Lights and Celebrity Traitors     
OL,5,Cmost watched BBC programmes in NI      
OL,6,GThe police drama Blue Lights and The   
OL,7,GCelebrity Traitors were the most       
OL,8,Gwatched BBC programmes in Northern     
OL,9,GIreland in 2025/2026.                  
OL,11,FThat is according to the               
OL,12,Fcommunications regulator Ofcom.        
OL,14,FCoverage of the North West 200 races,  
OL,15,FGAA, Irish league football and the     
OL,16,Fdocumentary Kinahan: The True Story of 
OL,17,FIreland's Mafia were also among the    
OL,18,Ftop programmes on the BBC iPlayer.     
OL,20,FMore widely, almost four-in-five       
OL,21,Fadults (78%) in Northern Ireland used  
OL,22,Fthe BBC at least once a week.     G4/4 
